      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakīma banondeelaga Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya henaho, ū Yesu ūja akūlomeelaga Ng'hūlū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu hose pye ū mu mizengo ī mitaale nī mido. Na a bahemba bakwe abo ikūmi na babīlī walī hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīmo na bakīma balebe, bangī baalī bīngījiwa masamva na bangī būpījiwa būsaatu; ūmò wa bakīma benabo walī Malia ūyo witanagwa Magadalena, ū ng'wene gaalī gang'wīnga masamva mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūngī walī Yoana nke wa ng'wa Kūza, ūyo walī nang'hani wa sabo ja ng'wa Helode. Walīmo na Susana, na bangī bingī dūhū, abo babagunanhaga kūfuma mu sabo jabo benekīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha mībi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ibita itaale libilinga, banhū bingī kūfuma mu būlī nzengo būng'wikuunūkīla ū Yesu. Wandya kūbalomeela bo kūtūmamīla shigemeng'hejo; ūhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mībi akaja kūbība mbīyū jakwe. Aho alībība jingī jūgwīla mu nzīla, jūpandagīlwa na kūlyiwa na noni ja kūlala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingī jūgwīla mu sī ya mawe mawe; aho jazwa jūcha nguno jikagayiwa ū būdoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingī jūgwīla mu ming'hwa, a ming'hwa gūkūlanīja najo gūjishiteleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo jimò jikagwīla mu sī yawiza, jūkūla jūtwaja mbeke igana igana.” Aho wamala ū kūhaya ī mihayo yenīyī ūbakomeleja; ūhaya gīkī, “Ūyo alī na matū gakigwaga ni igwage.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nguno ya kūtūmamīla shigemeng'hejo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba bakwe būmūja a makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla gīkī, “A bing'we ng'winhilwe būmani, mujimane ī mbisīla ja būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu, alīyo ū kū bangī shilī shigemeng'hejo dūhū; ībize gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo sha mībi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna lūūlū, a makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo shenīshi galī gīkī, ī mbīyū gūlī mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ījo jilī mu nzīla, balī abo bakagwigwaga ū mhayo; gwike ū Ng'wanishi wiza wagūpula ū mhayo wagwīnja ū mung'holò jabo, batizūzunya bakapījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ījo jilī mu sī ya mawe mawe, a bene balī abo bakagwigwaga ū mhayo bagwanukūla mu būyegi, gwike gwabiza gūtī na miji. Balī ba kūzunya kwa kakanza dūhū, alīyo ū mu makanza ga kūgeng'wa bakashokaga kū numa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ījo jigwīlile mu sī ya ming'hwa, a bene balī abo bakagwigwaga ū mhayo; gwike ū mu shimīzīle yabo bakashitelejiagwa na myatīla ya mu sī, hamò na būsabi wamo na kūdoosela būpanga, nose bakalemeelagwa nūūlū kūtwaja matwajo mashikanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ījo jilī mu sī yawiza, a bene h'abo bakagwigwaga ū mhayo mung'holò yawiza na ya logohano, bagūdima; bayūtwaja matwajo mu wiyūmīlīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha tala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna lūūlū managi gīkī atīho ūyo akabachaga tala wīkundīkīja itangwa, nūūlū wībisa ng'wizungu lya būlīīlī. Ī tala īkabachiagwa yatūūlwa h'ikīndīkīlo lyayo, gīkī pye abo bakwingīlaga ū mu kaya bayūlībona ī lisana lyayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gūtīho mhayo gwibisile nūūlū gūmò, ūyo gūtalafunījiwa ha ng'wape! Na hangī ītīho mbisīla īyo ītalitenda īkamanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ilang'hanagi ūmo mukūdegelekelaga; nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo alī na shikolo akwinhwa, lelo ūyo atī na shikolo, akūtaajiwa nī shisho akwiganikaga gīkī alī nasho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu na bang'wawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nina wiza hamò na a baana ba ng'wawe ū Yesu, baalī batogilwe kūshika aho walī, alīyo būlemeelwa kūlwa nguno y'ibita lya banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūwīlwa gīkī, “Ū noko alī hanze wīmīīlaga na a bazunayo; balītogwa kūkūbona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei ūbashokeja ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū nene ū mayū na a bazuna bane, balī abo bakagwigwaga ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu bagwīta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlembeeja nyanza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūngī ū Yesu akingīla mu lyato hamò nabo a bahemba bakwe; ūbawīla gīkī, “Tūjagi kū nkīlo gwa nyanza;” na ng'hana būbuga bajile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balīja, ū Yesu ūlaala tūlo. Kūhayimanīla gwabūūka nyaga ntaale bataalī ū mu nyanza. Ī lyato lyūyūdaha minzī, bibona babiza mu nhabaala ya kūyagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būmisha balīhaya gīkī, “Seeba Seeba, twashila!” Aho wamisha, ūgūhama ū nyaga na a mahuuli ga minzī, shūlembeela, hūbiza sele sele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla, “A bing'we ni kūlī halī ū kūzunya kwing'we?” Bakogoha no, būyūkumya dūhū ū kūnū baliwīla gīkī, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyū ī gete ni nani o kūyūhama na miyaga, būyaga na minzī pye shayūng'wigwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Munhū wa Gelasi kwīngījiwa masamva",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būbuga bajile, būūkashika kū sī ya Bagelasi, yalī yilolile nī Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wika ha sī nyūmu ūshimīza ajile, munhū nebe walī na masamva ūmanhya nang'hwe afumile kū nzengo. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī dūūhū, na walī wakwīja ī shikū atikalaga mu kaya, wikalaga kū mashigila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamona ū Yesu ūlīla n'ilaka itaale; ūgwa kū būtongi bokwe kūnū alīhaya gīkī, “Bebe Yesu Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu ūyo alī higūlya no, ūlī na mhayo kī nū nene? Nalīkwikūmbīlīja ūtizūniluhya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akahaya gīko nguno ū Yesu akalīlagīla ī lisamva līmfume ū munhū ng'wenūyo. Wikalaga abohiwe minyololo na nhendele, alīyo ng'hangala ningī ī lisamva lyandimaga wagatīnagūla a mabohejo, lyampeeja kūja kū matogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūmūja ū munhū ng'wenūyo gīkī, “Ī lina lyako ūlī nani?” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Nalī Mabita,” nguno a masamva ayo gaalī gang'wingīlīīla gaalī mingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna gūndayīīla gīkī atizūgalagīla gaje ng'wishimayenze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līkasangwa lyalīho idale lya ngulubī ningī jadīīmaga mu lūgūlū, gūndayīīla gīkī agazunīlīje gaje gakingīle mu jene; ūgazunīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A masamva aho gīnga ū mulī munhū ng'wenūyo, gūkingīla ū mu ngulubī jenījo; ī lidale ī lyose liyita nhambo kūjīlīīla kū lūgegu lo nyanza, jūkagwīla mu minzī, jūng'wa nhuli, jūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A badīīmi bajo aho babona yabiza gīko, būpeela nhambo, būja būūkagūkumūcha ū mhayo gwenūyo mu nzengo, nū kū magūngūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū būfuma kūja kūgūlola ūyo gūkilonga, aho bashika a halī Yesu būnsanga ū munhū ūyo gakamfuma masamva igashije hihī na mhambala ja ng'wa Yesu azwalile shizwalo, nīyo alī na masala madeekanu. Bakogoha no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bambona būbasomboolela ūmo akapīgījiwa ūyo walī na masamva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū ba mu sī ya Gelasi būng'wikūmbīlīja ū Yesu abīngīle, nguno bakagwīlwa booba būtaale no; ng'hana wingīla mu lyato ūshoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo akīngījiwa masamva ūng'wikūmbīlīja gīkī nū ng'wene adimane nang'hwe. Alīyo ū Yesu ūnaga aje; ūng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shokaga kaya ūkabawīle īyo Mulungu wakwītīlaga.” Ng'hana ūja hose pye ū mu nzengo gwenūyo, akwīkumūchaga īyo akīītīlwa na Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būdūla bo kūpīja na kūjūūcha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu aho washoka, ibita lya banhū lyūnsūng'wanha, nguno pye baalī banindīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla wiza ngosha ūmò, ntaale w'isinagogi; lina lyakwe Yailo. Aho washika ūngwīla mu magūlū ū Yesu, ūng'wikūmbīlīja ashike ha ng'wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nshīke wakwe, ng'wanikī wa myaka gītī ikūmi n'ībīlī, walī nsaatu no; nīyo hihī na kūcha. Hama walī nang'hwe ūmò ng'wenūyo dūhū. Ū Yesu aho wabūūka ajile, na mabita ga banhū gūnondeela, gūja gang'wishitelegije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho nkīma nebe wakoyiagwa būsaatu bo ngeji",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:43",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ngeji:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A henaha shandīkwa shingī shongegije na mihayo īyī: Kūshisha walī wajimala pyī ī sabo jakwe kūlwa kūjitūmamīla kū bafumu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", nose ūmala myaka ikūmi n'ībīlī; alīyo walī atīho nūūlū ūmò wa kūdūla kūmpīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūng'wizīīla ū Yesu kū numa, ūshika ūnkuumya kwipīndo lya ng'hanjo yakwe; haho na haho a mininga gakwe goya ū kūzwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūbūja, “Nani wanikuumya?” Aho bahuumūla pye a banhū, ū Petelo ūhaya, “Seeba a banhū balīkūkuumya nguno bakwishitelejaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu ūhaya, “Munhū nebe wanikuumya, nguno niyigwa nguzu janīnga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo aho wabona gīkī atūdūla ū kwibisa, wiza a halī Yesu alīdetema, ūshika ūntugīja mazwi ūnsomboolela hape hape kū būtongi wa banhū bose, ī nguno īyo īkang'wenheleja kūnkuumya, nū mumo akapīlīla haho na haho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Nshīke wane, ū kūzunya kwako kwakūpījaga; jaga mu mhola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ataalī ūyomba nabo gīko, kūhayimanīla wiza munhū afumile ū kū ng'wa ntaale w'isinagogi; ūshikīla kūhaya gīkī, “Ū nshīke wako wazumalīka, nose ītīho nguno ya kūnkoya ū Nangi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu aho wigwa ūng'wīla gīkī “Ūtogohage bebe ng'wene sanyaga, akūpīla dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika a ha kaya, atanzunīlīgije ose ose ū kwingīla, ūlū atī Petelo na Yohana na Yakobo; hamò na ise nū nina wa ng'wanikī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū balīlaga, balīnīla ū ng'wanikī! ū Yesu ūbawīla gīkī, “Mutalīlage nguno atachile, alaalile dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnseka nyachilū chilū kūlwa kūndalaha, nguno baalī bamanile gīkī ū ng'wanikī walī wamala kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei ūndima nkono; hūna witana alīhaya, “Ng'wanikī būūkaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū moyo gokwe gūnshokela, ūbūūka haho na haho. Ū Seeba ūbalagīla bang'winhe shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A babyaji bakwe bakakumya no; alīyo ū wei ūbalemeja batizūng'wīla munhū nūūlū ūmò ūyo gūkilonga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
